<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.vessel.reads ~ the pure read: bootstrap, storage, port, falls, held ids

`lares vessel read` inspects the bootstrap, the storage, the port, the resting engine's falls and every held id from the files beside the store, and starts nothing, so it answers a fallen vessel too. `palaces=true` reads the palaces' doctor report; `root=` names the vessel root.

<<~/ahu>>

