```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`palaces` params=`kind/switch ~ read the palaces' doctor report`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`root` params=`takes/dir ~ the vessel root (LAR_ROOT) this call reads`>>
```

